      "title": "Delete route without admin check",
      "description": "The delete route omits the requireAdmin middleware that its sibling routes on lines 7 and 16 use. server.js mounts the router with no app-level auth, so nothing else guards it. Any unauthenticated caller can delete any user by sending DELETE /admin/users/:id. Add requireAdmin to the route, matching the other admin routes.",
      "suggested_change": "admin.delete(\"/users/:id\", requireAdmin, async (req, res) => {",
